---
description: After code changes that affect the shipped app, run pack automatically.
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx,js,cjs,css}"
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user requests HRM app changes that require a production artifact, finish the task by running from the project root:

- `npm run build` if TypeScript/Vite output must be verified, and
- `npm run pack` (or `npm run setup` when dependencies may have changed) so `HRM-app\HRM-Desktop.exe` is updated.

Do not leave repacking for the user unless the environment cannot run npm (e.g. Node missing).
